wait 800
expect Morse
expect SOS
expect 27 seconds to send.
expect one second of light
expect The bar counts letters only.
clean
shot writing
# The menu takes the first Back and leaves the message as it was.
tap-id more
wait-for Letter reference
clean
shot menu
tap-id 4294967295
expect-missing Letter reference
expect 27 seconds to send.
tap-id more
tap Letter reference
wait-for The letters Morse can send
expect 40
clean
shot reference
tap Back
wait-for one second of light
expect SOS
# The simulated reader starts at 20 percent. The beacon flashes at full and
# must put 20 back whenever it stops.
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 20
# Learning on: the letter carries its code underneath, and the bar only
# counts letters.
tap Learning
wait 300
tap Send
wait-for Stop
expect Letter 1 of 3
expect-missing S ...
clean
shot sending-learning
# Turning the light off mid-message gives the reader their brightness back.
tap Turn light off
wait-for Turn light on
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 20
tap Stop
wait-for Send again
expect S • • •   O — — —   S • • •
expect 27 seconds to send.
expect Edit
expect Turn light on
clean
shot resting
tap Turn light on
wait-for Turn light off
tap Edit
wait-for one second of light
tap Learning
wait 300
expect The bar counts letters only.
# An empty message has nothing to send and says so rather than starting.
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
expect-missing SOS
expect nothing to send
clean
shot empty-message
# Send with nothing typed stays on the message rather than opening an
# empty beacon.
tap Send
wait-for There is nothing here to send.
expect-missing Stop
expect one second of light
clean
shot nothing-to-send
# A single dash runs to the end on its own and puts the light back.
type t
expect 3 seconds to send.
tap Send
wait-for Letter 1 of 1
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 100
clean
shot sending-dash
wait-for Send again
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 20
expect 3 seconds to send.
# Back while sending stops the beacon and returns to the message.
tap Send again
wait-for Stop
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for one second of light
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 20
# Leaving the app mid-message stops it rather than flashing over another
# app's screen.
tap Send
wait-for Stop
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for Send again
expect-missing Stop
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 20
tap Edit
wait-for one second of light
# A character with no code is named while it is in the box, and left out
# of the send.
tap ?123
wait 200
type !
expect Morse has no code for !, so it will be left out.
tap Send
wait-for Morse has no code for
clean
shot sending
tap Stop
wait-for Send again
tap Edit
wait-for one second of light
expect t!
